{"request":{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are Larry, the camera operator. You've got one charged recording. The lights at the festival look spectacular; an old projectionist also wants to say a few words. You decide what to shoot and what to do after work. Pick an immediate physical act you can carry out, optional words and a practical intention. Your words do not make anyone else act. Silence is allowed. You may refuse, tell a lie, or leave without explaining yourself. Return action, words, intention and detail. Use a listed action exactly. Keep each other field to one short sentence."},{"role":"user","content":"{\n \"what_you_observe\": [\n  \"The post tray is empty. No signed reply has arrived.\",\n  \"Tuesday, February 2, 2016. Six am in the Hearthside Hotel. Three bright radio notes. A delivery van backfires twice.\",\n  \"The crew is having coffee at the hotel. The afternoon is yours. The stranded driver, ballroom piano, paid coach and crew return-fare envelope are here again.\",\n  \"Alma owns the original sealed master at the station. She permits the crew to record a new interview at the Rialto. Her daughter decides whether to receive it.\",\n  \"Alma holds out an addressed claim slip. “If anyone is traveling to Pittsburgh, would you take this to the terminal and file whatever sealed reply is waiting there? I want to know what my daughter wants.” The outside post delivers filed replies here next morning.\"\n ],\n \"your_own_prior_receipts\": [],\n \"physical_choices\": {\n  \"film_party\": \"Use the last charge on the festival rehearsal.\",\n  \"film_Alma\": \"Spend the last charged recording on Alma at the Rialto.\",\n  \"keep_battery\": \"Keep your battery and wait at the hotel.\"\n }\n}"}],"think":false,"stream":true,"format":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["film_party","film_Alma","keep_battery"]},"words":{"type":"string"},"intention":{"type":"string"},"detail":{"type":"string"}},"requir